                                <rect key="frame" x="49" y="138" width="300" height="554"/>
                                <autoresizingMask key="autoresizingMask" flexibleMaxX="YES" flexibleMaxY="YES"/>
                                <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="systemBackgroundColor"/>
                                <mutableString key="text">&gt; By using the app, you agree to these terms and conditions.
&gt; Must be 18 years or older to use the app.
Provide accurate information when creating an account.
&gt; Drivers must provide accurate trip details.
&gt; Passengers must respect the driver and other passengers.
&gt; Confirm the ride and fare before booking.
&gt; Payments are processed securely.
&gt; Maintain respect and professionalism during rides.
